OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy centre launched to cut
OL,4,Awinter heating costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new energy centre has been launched
OL,7,Fin Wolverhampton's Heath Town estate.
OL,9,FThe new centre features 48 roof-mounted
OL,10,Fevaporators serving air source heat
OL,11,Fpumps, alongside supplementary boilers
OL,12,Fdesigned to be hydrogen-ready. The
OL,13,F#19.5 million investment is aimed at
OL,14,Freducing energy costs and improving
OL,15,Fheating for more than 1,000 residents.
OL,17,FThe existing boiler house was nearing
OL,18,Fthe end of its serviceable life, with
OL,19,Frepairs becoming increasingly difficult
OL,20,Fas replacement parts became harder to
OL,21,Fsource.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
