OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy centre launched to cut
OL,4,Awinter heating costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Wolverhampton Council said the
OL,7,Ffacility would replace ageing
OL,8,Finfrastructure with modern technology,
OL,9,Fdesigned to provide a more reliable and
OL,10,Fefficient heating network.
